Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed in part;
ii) The impugned Judgment & Award dated 29th August, 2019 passed by the Tribunal in MVC No.1180/2018, is modified.
iii) The appellant/claimant would be entitled to compensation of Rs.3,85,768/-
(Rupees three lakhs eighty-five thousand seven hundred and sixty-eight only) as against Rs.3,36,768/-
awarded by the Tribunal.
iv) The interest awarded by the tribunal at the rate of 9% per annum on the compensation amount of Rs.3,37,000/- is left undisturbed;
v) The enhanced compensation amount shall be paid with interest at 6% per annum by the - 11 - NC: 2024:KHC:6657 respondent no.1/insurer within a period of four weeks from the date of receipt of copy of this judgment;
vi) The compensation amount shall be released in favour of the appellant-claimant as per the terms of the tribunal upon proper identification.

